      "unit_id": "4b1bcea7e64ec2cd2589a2d069a27c6988475dc9e34ec03a0ccfc3780876c89a",
      "unit_type": "prose",
      "text": "Grit and Grime — PULSATING HAVEN FOR GOBLINS AND THEIR KIN, GRITE AND GRIME ELECTRIFIES THE ATMOSPHERE WITH WILD ENERGY AND THE THRUM OF ELECTRONIC DANCE MUSIC. SPRAWLING GEARS AND SPARKING COILS GIVE IT A DISTINCTLY STEAMPUNK AMBIANCE. GRIT AND GRIME WAS ONCE AN ABANDONED FACTORY BEFORE A PARTICULARLY ENTERPRISING GOBLIN",
