      "text": "NAMED GROBNOK SAW ITS POTENTIAL FOR PROFIT—AND RAMBUNCTIOUS REVERLY. GATHERING FELLOW GOBLINOIDS, HE TRANSFORMED IT INTO THE SENSATIONAL DANCE HUB IT IS TODAY. NOTORIOUS FOR ITS RAUCOUS PARTIES AND OTHERWORLDLY DJ SETS, GRIT AND GRIME IS WHERE GOBLINS AND ASSORTED CREATURES UNWIND LIKE NOWHERE ELSE.",
